config.baubleye.creativeAccessibility=Creative Baubles Accessibility
config.baubleye.creativeAccessibility.tooltip=True if the Baubles inventory button should be added to the creative inventory. Only active while the creative inventory patch is also enabled.
config.baubleye.slot=Elytra Bauble Slot
config.baubleye.slot.tooltip=Possible values: AMULET, RING, BELT, TRINKET, HEAD, BODY, CHARM.

config.baubleye.enabled=Enabled
config.baubleye.enabled.tooltip=A setting that turns off all baubles patches. If this is left enabled, each patch can be configured independently.
config.baubleye.patchBaublesMissingCreativeInventory=Baubles Creative Inventory Patch
config.baubleye.patchBaublesMissingCreativeInventory.tooltip=Allows the baubles inventory to be accessed from the creative inventory. Also fixes a couple minor inventory bugs.
config.baubleye.patchBaublesEnchantments=Baubles Enchantments Patch
config.baubleye.patchBaublesEnchantments.tooltip=Allows baubles equipment to be included when enchantments scan for items that have them applied. Also fixes curse of binding not working for items in baubles slots.
config.baubleye.patchBaublesItemSync=Baubles Inventory Sync Patch
config.baubleye.patchBaublesItemSync.tooltip=Fixes baubles inventory synchronization code, so that items with capability data send their capability data to the client.
config.baubleye.patchBaublesPlayerDrops=Baubles Player Loot Patch
config.baubleye.patchBaublesPlayerDrops.tooltip=Makes baubles add all items in its slots to the player drops list before spawning them in the world. This fixes many interactions that rely on the player drops list, like gravestone mods. Also fixes curse of vanishing not working for items in baubles slots.

